👑🧠 Birbal and the Most Important Thing (Raw Story)

One day, Emperor Akbar asked his court, “What is the most important thing in life?”

Many courtiers gave answers.

One said, “Wealth is the most important.”

Another said, “Power is the most important.”

Akbar then asked Birbal.

Birbal replied, “The most important thing is time.”

Akbar asked, “Why do you say that?”

Birbal said, “Because time once lost can never be brought back. It is more valuable than wealth or power.”

Akbar agreed with Birbal.

💖 Moral:

Time is the most valuable thing in life.
